## 4. Conformance Test Status

The suite is divided into 5 static phases and 1 runtime phase. All Python tests are currently passing.

### Phase 1: Parse & Lexing (15/15 Pass)
Tests basic grammar, strings, escapes, directive ordering, and trivial files.
*   *Key Tests:* `P-02` (strings with brackets), `P-08b` (directives are comment-free), `P-09b` (hard exit on v1.0), `P-15` (TXG025 misplaced @txg).

### Phase 2: Resolve & Scope (11/11 Pass)
Tests hoisting, forward references, missing files, and path containment.
*   *Key Tests:* `R-03` (TXG004 undeclared), `R-06` (TXG008 three subcodes), `R-07` (TXG015 path escapes).

### Phase 3: Graph Topology (19/19 Pass)
Tests loops, SCCs, fallbacks, and reachability.
*   *Key Tests:* `G-04` (multi-path SCC), `G-06` (irreducible flow TXG019), `G-10` (TXG016 duplicate fork), `G-15` (TXG018 non-dominating carry).

### Phase 4: Semantics & Annotations (16/16 Pass)
Tests permissions, idempotency, and directive ranges.
*   *Key Tests:* `S-02` (TXG010 permission), `S-05` (TXG021 non-idempotent loop), `S-08` (TXG013 duplicate annotations), `S-10/S-11` (TXG022 dual severity).

### Phase 5: Context Budgeting (10/10 Specified)
Tests token arithmetic, dynamic loops, and deduplication.
*   *Key Tests:* `B-04` (peak_iteration blowup), `B-05` (multi-branch deduplication). 
*   *(Status: B-01 through B-10 are fully specified and awaiting JS parity).*

### Runtime Engine (9/9 Pass)
Tests AST execution, mocks, and envelope generation.
*   *Key Tests:* `RT-01` (present/empty/absent), `RT-06` (exhaustion suppression), `RT-08` (budget halt), `RT-09` (ask + judge routing).

